<title>USA: CCC cancels U.S. corn purchase for Rwanda.</title>
<headline>CCC cancels U.S. corn purchase for Rwanda.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it would not purchase up to 16,000 tonnes U.S. No.2 or better yellow corn for donation to Rwanda due to program restrictions.</p>
<p>Shipment period had been set for December 5-30.</p>
<p>At this time, &quot;We do not know if we will retender,&quot; a CCC official said.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
